<title>USA: Johnson Cty SDFC, Ky., won by J.J.B Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Johnson Cty SDFC, Ky., won by J.J.B Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.J.B Hilliard, W.L. Lyons, Inc. said it won $4.670 million of Johnson Cty SDFC, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net  interest cost of 5.2964 percent.</p>
</text>
